msgid "训龟大师的攻击额外造成 2% 目标最大生命值的魔法伤害。每次攻击获得 3% 攻击速度，可无限叠加。层数达到 10、25、50 时亮起共鸣光效。"
msgstr "The Turtle Trainer's attacks deal bonus magic damage equal to 2% of the target's max health. Each attack grants 3% attack speed, stacking infinitely. A resonance glow lights up at 10, 25 and 50 stacks."

msgid "训龟大师朝随机一个敌人射出钩索，命中第一个敌人时将其眩晕 2.5 秒并拉向训龟大师。冷却 30 秒，未命中时冷却 15 秒。"
msgstr "The Turtle Trainer fires a grappling hook at a random enemy. The first enemy hit is stunned for 2.5 seconds and pulled to the Trainer. Cooldown 30 seconds (15 seconds on a miss)."

msgid "训龟大师朝友军最密集的地方投掷药水。落点附近的友军获得 5 秒狂热：攻击速度提高 30%，移动速度提高 25%，龟能充能速度提高 25%。冷却 16 秒。"
msgstr "The Turtle Trainer throws a potion at the densest group of allies. Nearby allies gain Frenzy for 5 seconds: +30% attack speed, +25% move speed and +25% Energy charge rate. Cooldown 16 seconds."

msgid "训龟大师吹响口哨，随机召唤以下一种。护盾：全体友军获得 700 护盾，5 秒后逐渐消退。灵龟：召出一只灵体小龟，蓄力后打出一道贯穿气波，对命中的敌人造成 100 点 + 15% 目标最大生命值的真实伤害并将其击飞，护甲降低 30%，持续 5 秒。狂暴：全体友军 4 秒内攻击力提高 20%，获得 20% 生命偷取，且不会死亡。冷却 14 秒。"
msgstr "The Turtle Trainer blows a whistle and summons one of the following at random. Shield: all allies gain a 700 shield that decays after 5 seconds. Spirit Turtle: summons a spirit turtle that charges up and fires a piercing wave, dealing 100 + 15% of the target's max health as true damage to enemies hit, knocking them up and reducing their armor by 30% for 5 seconds. Rampage: for 4 seconds, all allies gain 20% attack damage and 20% lifesteal, and can't die. Cooldown 14 seconds."

msgid "训龟大师在敌人最密集的地方生成一条冰川，持续 6 秒。冰面上的敌人移动速度降低 40%，受到的伤害提高 20%。冷却 17 秒。"
msgstr "The Turtle Trainer creates a glacier at the densest group of enemies for 6 seconds. Enemies on the ice are slowed by 40% and take 20% more damage. Cooldown 17 seconds."

msgid "形象"
msgstr "Look"

msgid "每个战场开始 10 秒后，训龟大师锁定敌方造成伤害最高的单位，持续 15 秒：目标受到的伤害提高 15%，全体友军优先攻击该目标。冷却 40 秒，未命中时冷却 20 秒。"
msgstr "10 seconds into each battle, the Turtle Trainer marks the enemy unit that has dealt the most damage for 15 seconds: it takes 15% more damage and all allies focus it. Cooldown 40 seconds (20 seconds on a miss)."

msgid "训龟大师标记最近的敌人。该敌人下次死亡时以 30% 最大生命值复活并加入我方，复活后 2.5 秒无敌，此后每秒损失 5% 最大生命值，持续作战至终极战场。冷却 999 秒，未命中时冷却 30 秒。"
msgstr "The Turtle Trainer marks the nearest enemy. The next time it dies, it revives with 30% max health and joins your side. It is invulnerable for 2.5 seconds after reviving, then loses 5% max health per second, fighting on into the Final Battle. Cooldown 999 seconds (30 seconds on a miss)."

